Setting a key appends it to the marker, says nothing on stdout, and reports the pair on
stderr. The marker's leading comment, its quoted project_name and its key order come back
byte-for-byte: only the appended line is new.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
# booping project marker
project_name: "demo"  # quoted on purpose
vault_path: ./vault
-- cmd --
booping marker-set latest_migration=3
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
marker: latest_migration=3
-- expected/cwd/.booping --
# booping project marker
project_name: "demo"  # quoted on purpose
vault_path: ./vault
latest_migration: 3
